ing patterns. My main strength lies in the Dots (B) suit tiles which can form multiple sequential combinations (B5-B6-B7 and B7-B8-B9), plus I have a concealed pung of F2 (South Wind). Keeping all B-suit tiles maintains maximum flexibility for drawing into a winning hand, while W2 provides no such benefit.\n\nAnswer: Play W2"}
